---
/**
 * Legacy `/result/YYYY-MM-DD/<slug>` alias.
 *
 * The original discarded the `slug` segment entirely and redirected on the date
 * alone, which is preserved here rather than "improved" — changing it would
 * alter where existing indexed URLs land.
 */
return Astro.redirect(`/kerala-lottery-result/${Astro.params.date}`, 308);
